⚡🇵🇰/🏴 — KARACHI: On June 27th, TTP's shadow group, Jamat-ul-Ahrar terrorists carried out a vehicle-borne IED attack on a Rangers installation near Gulshan-e-Iqbal. Alert guards at the gate responded swiftly, containing the attackers. Five terrorists have been sent to hell. 

The subgroup named as "Khulafaye Rashideen Isteshhadi Kandaq" has claimed responsibility for the attack.

